{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/8cb7530e4d3a6d42a8ce3e550bfca9be.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stars of Icarus is the latest spaceship combat game from the team behind <strong>Guns of Icarus</strong>. In the outer reaches of space, teamwork is the only thing you can trust. Form a crew with friends and strangers alike to face off in a tactical online PvP ship-based combat game. Choose your ship, join your squadron, customize your loadout, and become the Frontier\u2019s most lethal crew. Will you master the stars or burn out in a blaze of glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/db41d7e72d6c3ebd3bcddbc1c5bc904a.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/db41d7e72d6c3ebd3bcddbc1c5bc904a.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e73d2ac73e53bc459da91addfc92acd3.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/83e3a126ebf2ebe110420fded2454a72.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/83e3a126ebf2ebe110420fded2454a72.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With six distinct ships and over 25 squad formations, strategize with your team to take advantage of every ship\u2019s strengths. Strike fast with high-speed solo fighters, provide mission-critical support in the two-seater corvettes, or call in the big guns with a three-person frigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/81f59c03ef5ea0cc839cbc61634f4309.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e7622f7d0b1802ae1771d1bd7aa1e02c.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e7622f7d0b1802ae1771d1bd7aa1e02c.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stars of Icarus is all about teamwork - when the ship goes down, the crew goes down with it. Customize your character, assemble your crew and jump into classic multiplayer action! Whether you\u2019re navigating the cosmic fog, manning the cannons to wipe out enemy ships, or ensuring the shields hold \u2013 your team is relying on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/3927ddb8d768e094336f2f488194cfa4.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e0dffb8e2b586d64b75fa2820db835b6.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e0dffb8e2b586d64b75fa2820db835b6.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master a variety of engineering tools, arm your ship with different weapons and ammo types, and experiment with a range of special skills and drives. Access the full armory of weapons and equipment from the get-go, and discover your favorite loadout. No grinding. No pay-to-win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/09404927db260584ce7954e8d156fa06.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/997b6e8ec5d184ac3d3237fcfc4e6b34.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/997b6e8ec5d184ac3d3237fcfc4e6b34.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tell tales of your narrow escapes from enemy fire, drifting through asteroid fields with half an engine and a broken antenna. Each arena adds its own hazards through a dynamic environment you\u2019ll need to navigate. Learn from veterans, adapt, and master the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/9bb6eb5ea4fa2411446f8388e409ece4.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/1da3847cf87ccdf54576cd3bd99aa306.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/1da3847cf87ccdf54576cd3bd99aa306.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Stars of Icarus</i> continues a decade-long legacy. <i>Guns of Icarus Online</i> pioneered the crew-based PvP airship experience back in 2012. Stars of Icarus is the next chapter, providing a modernised experience of the classic multiplayer PvP experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2278950?t=1769641242","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/e26bcb3f0bcfd3a6d0036025b2d59238ccf864dd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769641242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/f5a630832cdb1e27d7cf8297d90a148d894b790e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769641242","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/f5a630832cdb1e27d7cf8297d90a148d894b790e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769641242","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/a91081b702a31498461b0fc1aac1ae44.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Loadouts</strong> - Scout, sneak, and strike with loadouts that you tailor to your playstyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fleet Formations</strong> - Command everything from nimble 1-seat Fighters to heavy 3-seat Frigates. Gather your teammates and plan the perfect fleet. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Arenas</strong> - Engage in multiple diverse battlefields with a range of soft and hard cover, designed for tactical depth. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Crew Roles</strong> - Fly solo, captain a multi-crew vessel, or man the stations to help repair the ship and take out adversaries in true 6DOF combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Online Play</strong> - Jump into 5v5 casual or competitive matches, or create and join custom servers with the capacity for larger matches. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Customisation</strong> - Personalize your pilot and ships with unique styles, and unlock new looks through continued skirmishes and play.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/8cb7530e4d3a6d42a8ce3e550bfca9be.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stars of Icarus is the latest spaceship combat game from the team behind <strong>Guns of Icarus</strong>. In the outer reaches of space, teamwork is the only thing you can trust. Form a crew with friends and strangers alike to face off in a tactical online PvP ship-based combat game. Choose your ship, join your squadron, customize your loadout, and become the Frontier\u2019s most lethal crew. Will you master the stars or burn out in a blaze of glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/db41d7e72d6c3ebd3bcddbc1c5bc904a.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/db41d7e72d6c3ebd3bcddbc1c5bc904a.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e73d2ac73e53bc459da91addfc92acd3.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/83e3a126ebf2ebe110420fded2454a72.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/83e3a126ebf2ebe110420fded2454a72.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With six distinct ships and over 25 squad formations, strategize with your team to take advantage of every ship\u2019s strengths. Strike fast with high-speed solo fighters, provide mission-critical support in the two-seater corvettes, or call in the big guns with a three-person frigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/81f59c03ef5ea0cc839cbc61634f4309.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e7622f7d0b1802ae1771d1bd7aa1e02c.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e7622f7d0b1802ae1771d1bd7aa1e02c.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stars of Icarus is all about teamwork - when the ship goes down, the crew goes down with it. Customize your character, assemble your crew and jump into classic multiplayer action! Whether you\u2019re navigating the cosmic fog, manning the cannons to wipe out enemy ships, or ensuring the shields hold \u2013 your team is relying on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/3927ddb8d768e094336f2f488194cfa4.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e0dffb8e2b586d64b75fa2820db835b6.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e0dffb8e2b586d64b75fa2820db835b6.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master a variety of engineering tools, arm your ship with different weapons and ammo types, and experiment with a range of special skills and drives. Access the full armory of weapons and equipment from the get-go, and discover your favorite loadout. No grinding. No pay-to-win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/09404927db260584ce7954e8d156fa06.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/997b6e8ec5d184ac3d3237fcfc4e6b34.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/997b6e8ec5d184ac3d3237fcfc4e6b34.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tell tales of your narrow escapes from enemy fire, drifting through asteroid fields with half an engine and a broken antenna. Each arena adds its own hazards through a dynamic environment you\u2019ll need to navigate. Learn from veterans, adapt, and master the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/9bb6eb5ea4fa2411446f8388e409ece4.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/1da3847cf87ccdf54576cd3bd99aa306.poster.avif?t=1769641242\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/1da3847cf87ccdf54576cd3bd99aa306.webm?t=1769641242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Stars of Icarus</i> continues a decade-long legacy. <i>Guns of Icarus Online</i> pioneered the crew-based PvP airship experience back in 2012. Stars of Icarus is the next chapter, providing a modernised experience of the classic multiplayer PvP experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Muse Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/f602a35691f1e753f2964d1b310f2d7af610c493/header.jpg?t=1769641242","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2278950/1143083596/752721d6434e9a05ef3f9032a19d8db621db1816/1758731013/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758732706","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2278950/1143083596/752721d6434e9a05ef3f9032a19d8db621db1816/1758731013/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758732706","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.aka